      "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nFix EP overlap chunking failures caused by dimension-0 shape queries on same-root AllToAll outputs. These queries could incorrectly trigger full-output materialization and raise:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nValueError: Chunk pass cannot materialize live-out without chunk dimension\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Keep same-root AllToAll dimension-0 shape queries attached to chunk-local outputs, avoiding unnecessary full-output materialization.\r\n- Preserve existing materialization behavior for other consumers.\r\n- Add a CPU-only FakeTensor/FX regression test exercising `ep_overlap_chunk_pass` with dispatch/combine AllToAll operations and a symbolic shape guard.\r\n  - Reproduces the original error before the fix and passes afterward.\r\n  - Verifies that only the combine output requires concatenation.",
      "changedFiles": 2,
      "comments": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "author": {
